  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LWF will in Tuzla reconstruct 555 houses of which 390 during 2006 and 165 in 2007. Selection of beneficiaries are carried out through municipal public calls and further selection interviews by LWF. Infrastructure repairs and in cooperation with municipal authorities, local communities and directly with beneficiaries will also be undertaken.</narrative>
